      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like a good start. but i'm worried about the pushback. some of the more traditional members of the board are going to say this is just \"woke capitalism\" or that we're abandoning our fiduciary duty to maximize shareholder value. can you add a section that addresses those criticisms? i want to show them that the critics are basically wrong and that focusing on social and environmental issues is actually the most \"fiduciary\" thing we can do.",
